## 6. Deployment & Infrastructure as Code (IaC)
**Concept:** Automate resource provisioning and app deployment using declarative templates or programmatic tools.

Key services/tools:
- AWS CloudFormation — declarative templates (YAML/JSON) to manage stacks.
- AWS CDK & AWS SAM — programmatic IaC and serverless application modeling.
- AWS CodeBuild / CodePipeline / CodeDeploy — CI/CD tools for build, test, deploy.
- Elastic Beanstalk — platform for deploying web apps quickly.
- OpsWorks — Chef/Puppet configuration management.
- AWS Proton — template-driven deployments for teams.

Exam tips:
- Understand CloudFormation change sets and rollback behavior.
- CDK synthesizes to CloudFormation templates under the hood.

![Typical pipeline: code → build → test → deploy](images/ci-cd-pipeline.png)

