## 8. Auditing & Security Monitoring
**Concept:** Record account/API activity, centralize security findings, and provide compliance artifacts.

Key services:
- AWS CloudTrail — records management and data plane API activity (management vs data events).
- AWS Security Hub — aggregates findings from GuardDuty, Inspector, Macie.
- Amazon GuardDuty — threat detection and anomaly monitoring.
- AWS Artifact — compliance reports (ISO, SOC, PCI, etc.).
- Amazon Inspector, Macie, Detective — vulnerability assessment, data classification, investigation.

Exam tips:
- Centralize CloudTrail logs to an S3 bucket, enable log file validation, and integrate with Athena for queries.

![Centralize CloudTrail logs across accounts](images/cloudtrail-centralization.png)

