## 9. Security Services
Key services:
- AWS WAF & Firewall Manager — web ACLs and centralized WAF management.
- AWS Shield (Standard & Advanced) — DDoS protection.
- AWS KMS & CloudHSM — key management and hardware-backed keys.
- AWS Secrets Manager — secrets storage & rotation.
- AWS Certificate Manager — manage SSL/TLS certificates.
- Amazon Macie, Inspector, Detective — data discovery, scanning, and investigation.

Exam tips:
- KMS is used by many AWS services for encryption; Secrets Manager supports automatic rotation for supported resources.

![KMS envelope encryption flow](images/kms-key-usage.png)

