## 11. Application Integration & Messaging
**Concept:** Decouple components, reliably deliver messages, and build event-driven architectures.

Key services:
- Amazon SQS — message queuing (Standard vs FIFO).
- Amazon SNS — pub/sub notifications and fan-out.
- Amazon EventBridge — event bus for AWS, custom apps, and SaaS integrations.
- AWS Step Functions — serverless workflow orchestration.
- Amazon MQ — managed message broker (ActiveMQ).
- AWS AppSync — managed GraphQL service.
- Amazon AppFlow — SaaS-to-AWS integrations (Salesforce, SAP, etc.).

Exam tips:
- FIFO queues guarantee ordering and exactly-once processing (with deduplication) vs standard queues (at-least-once delivery).

![EventBridge event bus → rules → targets](images/eventbridge-pattern.png)

