## 13. Machine Learning & AI
**Concept:** Managed services for model building, training, inference, and purpose-built AI APIs.

Key services & examples:
- Amazon SageMaker — end-to-end ML platform (build → train → deploy).
- Amazon Rekognition — image/video analysis.
- Amazon Textract — OCR and form extraction.
- Amazon Comprehend — NLP (sentiment, entities, PII detection).
- Amazon Lex / Transcribe / Polly — conversational and speech services.
- Amazon Kendra, Personalize, Forecast, Fraud Detector, Lookout, DevOps ML tools (DevOps Guru, CodeGuru).

![SageMaker build → train → deploy](images/sagemaker-workflow.png)

