## 14. Data Transfer & Migration
**Concept:** Move data and workloads to AWS with minimal downtime using online or offline methods.

Key services:
- AWS DataSync — automated data transfer over network.
- AWS Transfer Family — SFTP/FTPS/FTP to S3.
- AWS Snow Family (Snowcone, Snowball, Snowmobile) — physical data transport for large datasets.
- Application Discovery, AWS DMS, Server Migration Service (SMS), Migration Hub, Migration Evaluator.

Exam tips:
- Use Snow family when bandwidth is limited; use DMS for continuous DB replication with minimal downtime.

![DMS continuous replication architecture](images/dms-replication.png)

