## 15. Analytics & Big Data
**Concept:** Ingest, process, analyze and visualize streaming and batch data.

Key services:
- Amazon Kinesis (Data Streams, Firehose, Analytics, Video).
- Amazon EMR — managed Hadoop/Spark.
- AWS Glue — serverless ETL and data catalog.
- Amazon Athena — serverless SQL on S3.
- Amazon Redshift — data warehouse.
- Amazon QuickSight — BI and visualization.
- Amazon MSK — managed Kafka; OpenSearch Service — search & analytics.

When to use:
- Kinesis for streaming telemetry; Athena for ad-hoc queries on S3; Redshift for OLAP workloads.

![Kinesis data stream → consumers → storage/analytics](images/streaming-architecture.png)

