## 16. Management, Governance & Cost Control
Key services:
- AWS Management Console & CLI; SDKs.
- AWS Systems Manager — patching, automation, Parameter Store.
- AWS Config — resource compliance, drift detection and remediation.
- AWS Organizations & Control Tower — multi-account governance and SCPs.
- AWS Service Catalog & RAM — approved product catalogs and resource sharing.

Exam tips:
- SCPs provide account-wide guardrails and are applied at the Organization Unit (OU) level; they do not grant permissions.

![Control Tower & Organizations landing zone](images/multi-account-landing-zone.png)

