## Appendix — Quick Cheat Sheets
- One-line decisions: S3 = objects, EBS = block, EFS = shared file, DynamoDB = single-digit ms scale reads, RDS/Aurora = relational.
- Common patterns: Multi-AZ = HA; Read replicas = read scale; KMS = encryption key provider for many services.
- Common exam reminders: Differences between ALB vs NLB, SQS standard vs FIFO, CloudTrail management vs data events.

